    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abulahamu na Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abulahamu ūsaama, wīnga aho walī, ūja ūkazenga ipandī lya Negevu, ha gatī ya Kadeeshi na Shūūlī. Ikanza ilebe ūsegeja kwīnga na a henaho, ūkikala Geela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alī kwenūko ūyūng'haya ū nke ū Saala gīkī, “Ilūmbū lyane.” Kwimanīla Abimeleki, ū ntemi wa Geela, watūma banhū kūnjīla ū Saala; ūnsola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu ūng'wizīīla ū Abimeleki mu nzīla ya shilooti makanza ga būjikū, ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe ūlī mfu, kūlwa nguno ū nkīma ūyo wansolaga ng'wenūyo atoolilwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Abimeleki akasangwa ataalī ū kūng'wegeela; na lūūlū ūhaya, “SEEBA, ūkūkenaagūla ihanga nūūlū lītī na shilingo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūhaya waniwīlile wei ng'wenīkīlī gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū ilūmbū lyane;’ nū nkīma nang'hwe atahayile gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū nsīza wane?’ Ū mhayo gwenūyū nagwītaga mu būtūngīlīja na ng'holò yape gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūng'wīla ū mu shilooti shenīsho gīkī, “Ūlīhaya gwa ng'hana, namanile gīkī ū mhayo gwenūyū wagwītaga mu ng'holò yape, h'ī nguno yene natakūlekile ūnkuumye; nene ng'wenekīlī naakūhangījaga ūtizūnihūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nshoshage ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ū kūlī ngoshi; īkī ū wei ng'hangi, akūkūlombela ūbize mpanga. Alīyo ūlū ūtanshokije, managa hape gīkī ūkūcha, ū bebe ng'wenekīlī na a ba mu ng'wako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki aho wamisha ī ntondo yaho ī dilū, ūbitana a bana ng'oma bakwe, ūbasomboolela pyī ī yenīyo. A banhū benabo bakogoha no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Abimeleki ūng'witana ū Abulahamu, ūng'wīla, “Mhayo kī ū gwenūyū watwītīlile? Naakūkenije kī nose ūnenhela būbi būtaale gīko ū nene hamò nū būtemi wane? Ū bebe wanīītīlile mihayo īyo ītigelile kwītwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ongeja kūmūja ū Abulahamu, “Ī gete kī īsho shikakwenheleja nose wīte gīko?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūshosha, “Nakabona gīkī, a ha ipandī lyenīlī lūtīīho ū loogohano lwa ng'wa Mulungu, bakūnibūlaga kūlwa nguno ya nke wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a higūlya ya henaho, ū wei ī chene ng'hana ilūmbū lyane, nūūlū īkī nke wane; nguno tūsangīlile ū sīswe, tūūlekana a baniniswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Mulungu aho wanīnja ū mu numba ya ng'wa baba, ūnīīta kūbiza wa kūja nakūsaama saamaga, nakang'wīla gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nakang'wīla gīkī:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūyo akawīlwa Saala, atī Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ū būtogwa wako ūmo ūnitogelilwe ū nene, ūkūyūboolecha mu nzīla īyī, būlī kwene ūko tūkūja nihayage gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wenūyū sīza wane.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abimeleki wenha ng'holo na ng'ombe, na basese bagosha na bakīma; ūng'winha ū Abulahamu, ūnshokeja nū nke wakwe ū Saala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūng'wīla ū Abulahamu gīkī, “Ī sī yane yīyī kū būtongi wako īkūlindile; igashaga hose hose aho ūlasole bebe ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Saala ūng'wīla, “Ū nsīzayo nang'winha shekeeli shihūmbī shimò sha feza, kūlwa kūkundīkīja būhūbi ūbo walī wītīlilwe bebe kū būtongi wa banhū bose; ī haha ūlī wape.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yashila ī yenīyo, ū Abulahamu ūnombela ū Abimeleki nū nke, na a basese ba ha ng'wakwe a bakīma; būbiza na būdūla wa kūbyala hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu akasangwa wabalugalīla ū būbyīle pye a ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Abimeleki, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Saala, ū nke wa ng'wa Abulahamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
